{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9PdGhlci1MYW5ndWFnZS9TbGVlcGVyJTIwJTI4MjAxOCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"Sleeper","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/1fzQnmmEaoSHCEF1eHpeEg9CavC.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4GEMrlPx5nHDbTXpnYuZHlDkZ1p.jpg","description":"Up until now, marriage has been smooth sailing for Jennifer Jones. But after suffering a miscarriage, she begins to question her happiness and whether the spark in her marriage has dimmed. She shrugs it off as just being the 7-year itch and gives her husband, Freddy, who is content in their relationship, the benefit of the doubt. Things take an unexpected turn when Jennifer catches Freddy in a few unassuming lies. And when a sudden accident throws Freddy into a coma, Jennifer is left to pick up the pieces and reconcile everything for herself. With Freddy in hospital, a larger story begins to unfold - something that might just be Jennifer's worst nightmare - prompting her to question if she ever really knew the man she was married to.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Thriller","TV Movie","Others"],"imdbRating":"5.1","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Kara Killmer","Brett Donahue","Mylène Dinh-Robic","Rayisa Kondracki","Jason Deline","Joe Cobden","Mark Camacho","Barbara Gordon"],"director":["Philippe Gagnon"],"released":"2018-04-07T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Kara Killmer","character":"Jennifer Jones (JJ)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bfiSQa9YZXrYhlXgKazWc4jtoqD.jpg"},{"name":"Brett Donahue","character":"Freddy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i6IlT8BNpG21Hd44bQ8aiEH0slU.jpg"},{"name":"Mylène Dinh-Robic","character":"Connie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8iRZ9DOx59slSD2nrghJwAxfINJ.jpg"},{"name":"Rayisa Kondracki","character":"Anna","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1rEQ18Mohbr2yfR0iFAwUUU5iT0.jpg"},{"name":"Jason Deline","character":"Agent Doug Emory","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t